{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Turnos 是專為護士、飛行員及酒店員工等輪班人員設計的簡易日程管理工具，能自動計算並顯示未來的值班安排。這款 App 目前提供限時免費下載，讓用戶無需再手動記錄複雜的輪班週期，輕鬆掌握工作與休息時間。</p>\n\n<h2>智能輪班日程管理</h2>\n<p>只需輸入一次輪班週期，App 便會自動生成未來所有日期的班次詳情。主畫面即時顯示當日班次的開始與結束時間，月曆視圖則清晰標註整月安排以便預先規劃。支援 Apple Watch 查看未來六天行程，並透過小部件與通知功能，確保用戶在交接班前獲得準確提醒，避免錯過任何重要時刻。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-47-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-48-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-49-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-50-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-51-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-52-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Turnos Shift Rotation Calendar</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T17:38:59.440796+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}